            "review_text": "Olena0811\n7 contributions\n0\nThank you Chung!\nDec 2023 • Couples\nOne of the best examples of true service i have ever experienced. My husband and i stopped by around 10pm for drinks as we couldn't locate a taxi after the busy nightmarket. Every taxi in the city was fully booked....\n\nMr Chung from the cafe took care of everything, standing in the street and calling taxi companies to help get us back to our hotel. The world needs more people like Chung, absolute hero!\nRead more\nWritten December 18, 2023",
