            "review_text": "Aleksandra J\nCopenhagen, Denmark182 contributions\n0\nThe best smoothie\nSep 2023 • Couples\nWe came to this cafe - as espresso lovers - for coffee. I decided to try Vietnamese coffee with eggs. I drink coffee every day, but I remember whipped egg yolk and sugar from my childhood. And suddenly these two flavors were together, an interesting combination. However, the best thing was the mango smoothie - instead of regular milk it had condensed milk. I recommend\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 22, 2023",
